<section class="emotional-lookbook">
  <header class="emotional-lookbook-hero">
    <div>
      <p class="emotion-eyebrow">Editorial 001 / Emotional Collection</p>
      <h1>Two sides.<br> Same war.</h1>
    </div>
    <p>The recovered collection study: reconstruction, confrontation, and the emotional system that connects both.</p>
  </header>

  <div class="emotional-lookbook-lineup">
    <img src="{{ 'emotional-hero-v2.png' | asset_url }}" alt="Women's and men's Emotional Collection campaign" width="1680" height="945" loading="eager">
  </div>

  <div class="emotional-lookbook-statement">
    <p>Emotions are architecture.</p>
    <span>What you repeat becomes structure. What you confront becomes material. What you rebuild becomes yours.</span>
  </div>

  <div class="emotional-lookbook-grid">
    <figure class="is-tall">
      <img src="{{ 'product-rebuild-hoodie-back-v3.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="Rebuild Yourself women's cropped hoodie back" width="1024" height="1536" loading="lazy">
      <figcaption>01 / Reconstruction</figcaption>
    </figure>
    <figure>
      <img src="{{ 'art-emotional-duality-v1.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="Emotional duality collection artwork" width="1280" height="853" loading="lazy">
      <figcaption>The mask / The fracture</figcaption>
    </figure>
    <figure>
      <img src="{{ 'product-face-hide-hoodie-back-v3.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="Face What You Hide men's oversized hoodie back" width="1024" height="1536" loading="lazy">
      <figcaption>02 / Confrontation</figcaption>
    </figure>
    <figure class="is-wide">
      <img src="{{ 'about-hero-world-v1.png' | asset_url }}" alt="Emotional Collection garments and symbolic objects" width="1680" height="945" loading="lazy">
      <figcaption>The complete system</figcaption>
    </figure>
  </div>

  <footer class="emotional-lookbook-footer">
    <p>Face what you hide.</p>
    <a class="button button-gold" href="{{ routes.collections_url }}">Enter the collection {% render 'icon-arrow' %}</a>
  </footer>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Emotional lookbook",
  "settings": []
}
{% endschema %}
